OL,3,GNEWSAShould we switch time zones for
OL,4,Alighter evenings?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the clocks going back one hour on
OL,7,FSunday, people are discussing whether
OL,8,Fthe British Isles should change time
OL,9,Fzones to allow for lighter evenings.
OL,11,FA former politician who spearheaded a
OL,12,Freferendum for Jersey to adopt Central
OL,13,FEuropean Time (CET) has said he stands
OL,14,Fby his argument it would boost "quality
OL,15,Fof life".
OL,17,FIt was 18 years ago Jimmy Perchard
OL,18,Ftriggered the vote on whether Jersey
OL,19,Fshould change time zones to be aligned
OL,20,Fwith the Continent.
